# Immortal Sentries (ToAU 2, mission.toau.immortal_sentries). A level 75 Warrior of Bastok in Aht Urhgan Whitegate with
# it current and the Supplies Package: Naja Salaheem 3001 (the default dialog; text table 0). Arrapago Reef: Meyaada 5,
# finished with option 0: nothing; again, option 1: handlePackage (the package deleted, 150 imperial standing) and the
# HAND_OVER_TO_IMMORTAL and YOUR_IMPERIAL_STANDING messages. Without the package: Meyaada 6. Naja without it: 3002,
# finished: the two messages around the completion, the PSC Wildcat Badge, Private Second Class, President Salaheem
# current. The other zones' arms are the #bhaflau, #caedarva and #zhayolm flows.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3002 ArrapagoReef/Meyaada/onTrigger ArrapagoReef/onEventFinish/5
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau ImmortalSentries current
keyitem SuppliesPackage
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # the package: 3001
finish
warp 22.446,-7.92,573.39 ArrapagoReef
trigger Meyaada                         # the package: 5
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Meyaada                         # 5
finish option=1                         # handed over
trigger Meyaada                         # no package: 6
finish
warp 22.7,-8.804,-45.591 AhtUrhganWhitegate
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # no package: 3002
finish                                  # the messages, completed
